{# What happened to the account of the signed-in user (architecture §5.2, issues #454 and #571), in the
   language of the browser: one line per act the journal holds of them, each saying what it is by its own
   name, with the moment on their own clock and what the request carried of where it came from. The
   refusals are there on purpose: a line a person does not recognise is what this page is for, and the
   place beside the address is what makes one recognisable (issue #473); it is absent where the enrichment
   found nothing. Who did an act is said by a fragment of its kind (act_author/<kind>, decision 0066): an
   administrator of the tenant by their role in place of where it came from, and nothing else of them, a
   directory by its name, the others by where the act came from, as an act that names no author. An act
   is named from the catalogue, so an act this provider comes to write down is named here by being
   translated and this page is not edited.

   The list is narrowed by what ActsPage reads ("question", a JournalQuestion): the days of the act, one
   act of those "offered" ("act", the one read), and whether an administrator did it. #}
{% extends '@Beffroi/layout.html.twig' %}
{% trans_default_domain 'beffroi' %}

{% block title %}{{ 'acts.title'|trans }}{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
    {{ include('@Beffroi/account/back.html.twig') }}
    <p>{{ 'acts.explanation'|trans }}</p>
    {% embed '@Beffroi/account/filter.html.twig' %}
        {% trans_default_domain 'beffroi' %}
        {% block fields %}
            {{ include('@Beffroi/account/filter_choice.html.twig', {
                name: 'act',
                label: 'acts.what',
                any: 'acts.filter.every_act',
                options: offered|map(name => {value: name, label: ('act.' ~ name)|trans})|sort((a, b) => a.label <=> b.label),
                chosen: act,
            }) }}
            {{ include('@Beffroi/account/filter_choice.html.twig', {
                name: 'by',
                label: 'acts.from',
                any: 'acts.filter.from_anywhere',
                options: [
                    {value: 'request', label: 'acts.filter.from_a_request'|trans},
                    {value: 'administrator', label: 'acts.by_an_administrator'|trans},
                ],
                chosen: question.byAnAdministrator is null ? null : (question.byAnAdministrator ? 'administrator' : 'request'),
            }) }}
            {{ include('@Beffroi/account/filter_period.html.twig', {legend: 'acts.when', from: 'from', to: 'to', period: question.period}) }}
        {% endblock %}
    {% endembed %}
    <div data-table>
        <table data-acts="{{ acts|length }}">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>{{ 'acts.what'|trans }}</th>
                    <th>{{ 'acts.when'|trans }}</th>
                    <th>{{ 'acts.from'|trans }}</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for act in acts %}
                    <tr data-act="{{ act.act }}">
                        <td data-label="{{ 'acts.what'|trans }}">{{ ('act.' ~ act.act)|trans }}</td>
                        <td data-label="{{ 'acts.when'|trans }}"><time datetime="{{ act.occurredAt|date('c') }}">{{ act.occurredAt|beffroi_moment(user) }}</time></td>
                        <td data-label="{{ 'acts.from'|trans }}">
                            {%- if act.author is null -%}
                                {{ include('@Beffroi/account/provenance.html.twig', {provenance: act.context}) }}
                            {%- else -%}
                                {{ include('@Beffroi/account/act_author/' ~ act.author.kind ~ '.html.twig', {act: act}) }}
                            {%- endif -%}
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                {% else %}
                    {# A table that holds nothing keeps its head and says so in one row of its own, which is
                       how every table of this plane says it. #}
                    <tr data-empty><td colspan="3">{{ (narrowed ? 'acts.none_matching' : 'acts.none')|trans }}</td></tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
    {{ include('@Beffroi/account/pager.html.twig', {listing: acts}) }}
{% endblock %}
